:["A guiding light","A mighty fortress","A strong refuge","A merciful judge"],"correctAnswer":2,"correctAnswerEn":2,"reference":"நாகூம் 1:7","referenceEn":"Nahum 1:7","explanation":"நாகூம் 1 அதிகாரம்","explanationEn":"Nahum Chapter 1","difficulty":"medium"},{"id":"nahu_1_8","categoryId":"old_testament","bookId":"nahum","chapter":1,"verseNum":8,"question":"கர்த்தர் எதை முற்றிலும் அழித்துவிடுவார்?","questionEn":"What will the Lord do to the place of Nineveh?","options":["அந்த இடத்தைப் பலப்படுத்தி","அந்த இடத்தைப் பாழாக்கி","அந்த இடத்தைப் பரிசுத்தமாக்கி","அந்த இடத்தைப் பெருகப்பண்ணி"],"optionsEn":["Restore its walls","Forget its sins","Make an utter end","Spare its people"],"correctAnswer":1,"correctAnswerEn":2,"reference":"நாகூம் 1:8","referenceEn":"Nahum 1:8","explanation":"நாகூம் 1 அதிகாரம்","explanationEn":"Nahum Chapter 1","difficulty":"medium"},{"id":"nahu_1_9","categoryId":"old_testament","bookId":"nahum","chapter":1,"verseNum":9,"question":"கர்த்தருக்கு விரோதமாய் என்ன நினைக்கிறீர்கள்?","questionEn":"What will the Lord do to those who conspire against Him?","options":["தீமையான காரியங்களை","வீணான யோசனைகளை","பெருமையான எண்ணங்களை","பொல்லாப்பான திட்டங்களை"],"optionsEn":["He will exile them","He will forgive them","He will ignore them","He will make an end"],"correctAnswer":1,"correctAnswerEn":3,"reference":"நாகூம் 1:9","referenceEn":"Nahum 1:9","explanation":"நாகூம் 1 அதிகாரம்","explanationEn":"Nahum Chapter 1","difficulty":"medium"},{"id":"nahu_1_10","categoryId":"old_testament","bookId":"nahum","chapter":1,"verseNum":10,"question":"அவர்கள் எதைப்போலப் பட்சிக்கப்படுவார்கள்?","questionEn":"What are the enemies like when they are tangled like thorns?","options":["காய்ந்த புல்லைப்போல","காய்ந்த சருகுகளைப்போல","காய்ந்த விறகைப்போல","காய்ந்த சக்கையைப்போல"],"optionsEn":["Like strong cedar","Like heavy stone","Like green grass","Like dry stubble"],"correctAnswer":3,"correctAnswerEn":3,"reference":"நாகூம் 1:10","referenceEn":"Nahum 1:10","explanation":"நாகூம் 1 அதிகாரம்","explanationEn":"Nahum Chapter 1","difficulty":"medium"},{"id":"nahu_1_11","categoryId":"old_testament","bookId":"nahum","chapter":1,"verseNum":11,"question":"கர்த்தருக்கு விரோதமாய் யோசனை பண்ணுகிறவன் யார்?","questionEn":"What has come out of Nineveh against the Lord?","options":["துன்மார்க்கம் செய்கிறவன்","பொல்லாப்புச் செய்கிறவன்","வஞ்சகம் செய்கிறவன்","அநீதி செய்கிறவன்"],"optionsEn":["A wicked king","A lying prophet","A vast army","A wicked counselor"],"correctAnswer":1,"correctAnswerEn":3,"reference":"நாகூம் 1:11","referenceEn":"Nahum 1:11","explanation":"நாகூம் 1 அதிகாரம்","explanationEn":"Nahum Chapter 1","difficulty":"medium"},{"id":"nahu_1_12","categoryId":"old_testament","bookId":"nahum","chapter":1,"verseNum":12,"question":"அவர்கள் சமாதானமாயிருந்தாலும் என்னாவார்கள்?","questionEn":"What will happen to the enemies even if they are many?","options":["அவர்கள் சிதறடிக்கப்படுவார்கள்","அவர்கள் வெட்டப்படுவார்கள்","அவர்கள் அழிக்கப்படுவார்கள்","அவர்கள் ஒடுக்கப்படுவார்கள்"],"optionsEn":["They will be forgiven","They will be cut down","They will be scattered","They will be ignored"],"correctAnswer":1,"correctAnswerEn":1,"reference":"நாகூம் 1:12","referenceEn":"Nahum 1:12","explanation":"நாகூம் 1 அதிகாரம்","explanationEn":"Nahum Chapter 1","difficulty":"medium"},{"id":"nahu_1_13","categoryId":"old_testament","bookId":"nahum","chapter":1,"verseNum":13,"question":"கர்த்தர் எதை முறித்துப்போடுவார்?","questionEn":"What will the Lord break from off His people?","options":["அவர்கள் செய்த சிலைகளை","அவர்கள் வைத்த நுகத்தை","அவர்கள் கட்டிய கோட்டைகளை","அவர்கள் கொண்ட அதிகாரத்தை"],"optionsEn":["Their wooden yokes","Their stone walls","Their heavy chains","Their iron gates"],"correctAnswer":1,"correctAnswerEn":0,"reference":"நாகூம் 1:13","referenceEn":"Nahum 1:13","explanation":"நாகூம் 1 அதிகாரம்","explanationEn":"Nahum Chapter 1","difficulty":"medium"},{"id":"nahu_1_14","categoryId":"old_testament","bookId":"nahum","chapter":1,"verseNum":14,"question":"உன் பெயரைப் பிரஸ்தாபிக்க இனி ஒருவனும் இர